1
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:13,500
The Instruments tab lists everything your broker offers.

2
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:19,800
They are grouped by type — Forex, Crypto, Stocks and so on.

3
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,600
Each group shows a few to start with.

4
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:32,400
Click a group to see them all.

5
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:38,300
Click any instrument for more detail.

6
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:46,400
A panel slides in on the right.

7
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:52,800
It shows the live price and the day's range.

8
00:00:52,900 --> 00:01:03,100
Pivot points show possible support and resistance levels.

9
00:01:03,300 --> 00:01:09,100
Trading takes you back to the main screen.

